{
  "root_node": "source.raw.lineitem",
  "cause": "upstream_data",
  "action": "escalate",
  "evidence": "The failing dbt checks not_null_stg_lineitem_order_key and not_null_stg_lineitem_order_line_id each reported 1550 failing rows. In the source raw.lineitem table, a query shows 1550 rows with l_orderkey IS NULL and 0 rows with l_linenumber IS NULL. The stg_lineitem model directly maps l_orderkey to order_key and builds order_line_id via concatenation of l_orderkey and l_linenumber, so null l_orderkey propagates to both columns, causing the test failures. Since the raw source data itself contains null order keys, the issue originates upstream and must be escalated to the source data owner."
}
